          "type": "text",
          "content": "Kestrel Aviation — Q1 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Kestrel Aviation — Q1 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d21-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d21-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "This report summarises Kestrel Aviation's operating performance for Q1 2025. The business operates in charter operations and MRO, and the quarter was shaped by steady demand and margin pressure from freight costs. Figures are unaudited and reflect management accounts as of quarter close.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d21-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Identity platform is owned by the Trust & Safety team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Kwame Mensah, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 74.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d21-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Management notes that comparisons to the prior year are affected by the change in revenue recognition adopted at the start of the fiscal year.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 98.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d21-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 116.3
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d21-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Regional results are reported in constant currency. Revenue reflects recognised subscription and services revenue; growth is quarter-over-quarter; churn is logo churn measured at renewal; NPS is the trailing 90-day relationship score.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 130.7
          },
          "width": 166
        }
      ]
    },
